      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af468d" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left">Questions we're asked about <span class="gradient-text">e-wallets</span>:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af4693-6643cc86" data-w-id="51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af4693" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What is an e-wallet?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">An e-wallet in foodservice is a digital payment system used to carry out financial transactions in foodservice. It is a digital solution that enables diners to recharge an electronic account and use it to pay for their meals or snacks in a collective restaurant.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af46a0-6643cc86" data-w-id="51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af46a0" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Do my guests need badges?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">For restaurants and fast-food outlets, the benefits of a loyalty program are twofold. On the one hand, it rewards regular customers for their loyalty, and on the other, it encourages new customers to become loyal in their turn.<br><br>The other significant advantage of a digital loyalty program is the collection of information about its customers. This information enables us to better understand and target our customers, and thus refine our loyalty strategy to achieve the best possible results.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_0d4f3054-0d22-df25-b892-104dba8b7c1a-6643cc86" data-w-id="0d4f3054-0d22-df25-b892-104dba8b7c1a" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Can guests view their receipt?</h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. After each visit, a digital receipt is sent by email. This allows for transparent tracking and eliminates the need for paper printing.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
